210
00:11:03,580 --> 00:11:04,646
- Yeah, okay.
- Totally.
- ແມ່ນແລ້ວ, ດີ.
- ແນ່ນອນ.

211
00:11:04,648 --> 00:11:05,947
Really?
ແທ້ໆບໍ?

212
00:11:05,949 --> 00:11:07,716
I guess we can just take
